# The live front page streams in behind a skeleton; the pager only appears
# once stories land, so the route waits for it before touching the bar.
wait-for 1 of
expect Ask
clean
shot hn-top
tap Saved
wait-for Nothing here yet
expect Its article is kept on this reader
clean
shot hn-saved
# Save fetches the story's article and keeps it on the reader. The control
# reads Saving while it comes down and Saved once it is stored or has failed.
tap Top
wait-for 1 of
tap-id story-0
wait-for Save
clean
shot hn-thread
tap Save
wait-for Saved
tap Back
wait-for 1 of
tap Saved
expect-missing Nothing saved yet.
# Waited for, and whole: the control reads Saved as soon as the article is
# written, and the line counts it once the device has acknowledged the index.
# "eady offline" alone also matched "Nothing is ready offline yet."
wait-for Ready offline: 1 article
clean
shot hn-saved-offline
# A saved story survives the app closing: the list and its offline copy are
# on the reader, not in memory.
restart
wait-for 1 of
tap Saved
wait-for Ready offline: 1 article
expect Offline ·
clean
shot hn-saved-after-restart
# With the radio off the saved article still opens, from the book glyph in
# the discussion, and the discussion says why its comments are missing.
scenario offline
tap-id story-0
wait-for Discussion
tap-id read-article
wait-idle
shot hn-article-offline
# The reading menu sits in the middle of the page and says where you are.
tap-id reader-controls
wait-for Page
expect Front light
clean
shot hn-article-menu
# Back first puts the open panel away and keeps the article open.
tap-id 4294967295
wait-idle
expect-missing Front light
# Read it to the end. Live articles vary in length, so turn well past it.
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
wait-for This is the end
clean
shot hn-article-end
tap-id 4294967295
wait-idle
wait-for The article is saved on this reader
expect Join Wi-Fi
clean
shot hn-thread-offline-saved
tap Back
wait-for Ready offline: 1 article
# A live tab with no network says so as the whole screen, with Try again.
tap New
wait 9000
wait-for You're offline
expect Try again
clean
shot hn-new-offline
scenario normal
tap Try again
wait-for 1 of
# Page turns on a list go forward and back, and the bar says which page.
tap-id list-next
wait-for 2 of
clean
shot hn-new-page-2
tap-id list-back
wait-for 1 of
# Ask HN stories have no link, so the discussion offers no article.
tap Ask
wait-for 1 of
tap-id story-0
wait-for Discussion
expect-missing Read the article
expect Save
clean
shot hn-ask-thread
tap Back
wait-for 1 of
tap Show
wait-for 1 of
clean
shot hn-show
# A discussion folds a comment with its replies and opens it again, and its
# own pages turn.
tap Top
wait-for 1 of
tap-id story-0
wait-for-id fold-0
tap-id fold-0
wait-idle
clean
shot hn-thread-folded
tap-id fold-0
wait-idle
tap-id thread-next
wait-for 2 of
clean
shot hn-thread-page-2
tap-id thread-back
wait-for 1 of
# Tapping Saved in the discussion takes it off the list again.
expect Saved
tap Saved
wait-for Save
tap Back
wait-for 1 of
tap Saved
wait-for Nothing saved yet
clean
shot hn-saved-emptied
# Taking a story off from its row menu, the other way to remove one.
tap Top
wait-for 1 of
tap-id story-1
wait-for Save
tap Save
wait-for Saved
tap Back
wait-for 1 of
tap Saved
wait-for-id saved-menu-0
tap-id saved-menu-0
wait-for Take off this list
clean
shot hn-saved-row-menu
tap Take off this list
wait-for Nothing saved yet
clean
